+|--------|--------|-----------------|
+| **Tainted jerky / supply chain** | Active — trust crisis | Session 20 recap; Stafl’s audit; Sara Session 20 beat |
+| **Sara & Frank — “who can I trust?”** | Active | `NPCs/sara_mirathorn_operator/` |
+| **Tealeaf line** | Unanswered (Session 20 end) | Session 20 recap; `Stormspire Academy/` hubs |
+| **Lysandra** | With party; unreachable when she calls home | `NPCs/captain_lysandra_ironveil/` |
+| **Dustwalker / decoy** | Historical; real body elsewhere? | Session 12; `Elderwyld/Shephards Flock/NPCs/dustwalker/` |
+| **Festival of Expansion / choral oath** | Ledger: Shepherd phrasing in finale text | `Elderwyld_Narrative_Ledger_Campaign2.md` §8 |
+| **Magical storms over city** | Ongoing | Ledger §3 |
+| **Shepherd & Maelthor** | Ongoing | Ledger §1 |
+| **Rocky-talkie static / “Mael—”** | Ledger §37 | `Elderwyld_Narrative_Ledger_Campaign2.md` |
+
+---
+
+## Operators (quick voice)
+
+**Sara & Frank** — fraternal twins, Mirathorn switchboard. Session 21: **Frank** on the line, **festival hangover**, stressed, not cruel — **overwhelmed and cutting off** when the call gets too heavy.
+
+**Dossier:** `NPCs/sara_mirathorn_operator/sara_mirathorn_operator_character_dossier.md`
