+## 1. Executive prep read
+
+Session 22 is a **travel-and-pressure** session: the Questionable Company marches north while **Mirathorn silence**, the **storm**, and **music-from-the-north rumors** stack anxiety. Lysandra is emotionally present but **cut off from home**; Thrin needs a **deliberate foreground beat** so he does not fade. Bonogo has **flight boots** (and an unidentified slab) from the drake nest. Use **road d100 + conical-hill night camp d100** at the table — do not invent encounter rows in prep. **Mireward** is named; **place-build scaffold** exists (`Mireward_PLACE_BUILD_SCAFFOLD.md`) — iterate there until promotion (~5 days out — may not arrive this session unless you force-march).
