+| **81–90** (within 81–100) | Deserted hamlet — **Tollers Gap** (§9) | Rush-empty breadcrumb; search vs press on |
+| **31–40** | Waystation / half-inn | Warm tea, missing clerk — capacity before walls |
+| **51–60** | Shepherd sign | Ambiguous chalk / well — no sermon |
