ord dossier collection. dossiers mossford location dossiers half burned warehouse half burned warehouse voices_tower_blueprint Lysandra draws a top-down tower blueprint under cult-\n- [u-L0005-08] After conferring with Lysandra, they determine that they are 3 days from Mirathorn and the next little town north along the road will be Mireward, about 5 days out.\n- [u-L0005-06] They leave the wagon and the animals at the bottom and make their way up until they reach a giant bowl of water surrounded by a grove of trees.\n- [u-L0005-07] From this position they can see out along the plains for a fairly long distance.\n- [meta-session-0021-open-loops] session unresolved open questions loops open loops actionable follow up next session mirathorn_festival_resumed Mirathorn resumed the Festival; Frank hung up; Lysandra cannot get through — is the city compromised or merely distracted? elderwyld cities and towns cities and towns mirathorn swamp_vs_mirathorn_fork Party agreed to press on to the swamp rather than turn back — S22 opening pressure. longmont campaign longmont campaign campaign 2 parties questionable company questionable company\n- [u-L0015-06] Marla approaches Caelynn and asks her how she should deal with Bonogo, but Ephanna quickly intervenes, letting her, and the town, know that the Questionable Company is leaving town to continue their journey.\n- [u-L0019-12] She is very confused, wondering where she is and how she got there.\n- [u-L0023-01] Caelynn continues to wait on the line for an answer from Tealeaf as the rest of the group set up a proper camp for a rest.\n- [u-L0007-08] Karsemine sneaks back to the group and warns them that something is definitely living here.\n- [u-L0011-05] He apologizes to her, telling Caelynn that the city resumed the Festival and it was a long night.\n- [u-L0019-06] She says it is a tower where the voices are coming from and she knows where it is.\n- [u-L0003-13] The town, called Edge of the World, is about a one week trip to reach